{"3941780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "大戦略SSB2", "steam_appid": 3941780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4282890, 4282900, 4282910, 4282920, 4282930, 4282940, 4282950, 4375080], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Important Notes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Scenario Maps”: The in-game geopolitical commentary (scenario text) will not be displayed on the Steam version, but the gameplay content itself—including maps and weapons—can be enjoyed in the same way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have decided to localize the game so players outside Japan can enjoy it as well. Supported languages and release timing will be announced later.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bundle contents are updated as new production types are released. Any content added after your purchase (new additions only) must be bought separately at a bundle discount.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get fired up. Strategy is individuality.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since 1985, the <i>Daisenryaku</i> series has defined modern war strategy games. On every battlefield, victory hinges on how you deploy forces, balance offense and defense, and break the deadlock—your “Grand Strategy” is put to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941780/extras/388155e8a7321d98d8bc1b0c6203c817.avif?t=1787645947\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >300+ Units</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of more than 300 units—fighters, tanks, assault ships, and ASW aircraft—drawn straight from today’s active forces. Cutting-edge weapons still in development also make their debut, letting you experience the future of modern warfare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941780/extras/e0a3dc445216f6992505dfc6ba2f3103.avif?t=1787645947\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn-Based System for Careful Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles unfold on hex-based maps, with players and CPU taking turns. Lead your fleet across the seas, seize the skies with aircraft, advance over land with tanks—your careful planning shapes the course of the war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941780/extras/b6ed36f164de207986f9c697ad4e4074.avif?t=1787645947\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>50 Brand-New Maps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers 50 entirely new maps. From small islands suited for light play to large-scale battlefields for total war, both newcomers and experienced players can take their time and enjoy strategic gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941780/extras/5a670b0f5128d984323769776526045d.avif?t=1787645947\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941780/extras/2cb5c74ae6608bd18aaee5705b40b621.avif?t=1787645947\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Important Notes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Scenario Maps”: The in-game geopolitical commentary (scenario text) will not be displayed on the Steam version, but the gameplay content itself—including maps and weapons—can be enjoyed in the same way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have decided to localize the game so players outside Japan can enjoy it as well. Supported languages and release timing will be announced later.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bundle contents are updated as new production types are released. Any content added after your purchase (new additions only) must be bought separately at a bundle discount.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get fired up. Strategy is individuality.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since 1985, the <i>Daisenryaku</i> series has defined modern war strategy games. On every battlefield, victory hinges on how you deploy forces, balance offense and defense, and break the deadlock—your “Grand Strategy” is put to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941780/extras/388155e8a7321d98d8bc1b0c6203c817.avif?t=1787645947\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >300+ Units</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of more than 300 units—fighters, tanks, assault ships, and ASW aircraft—drawn straight from today’s active forces. Cutting-edge weapons still in development also make their debut, letting you experience the future of modern warfare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941780/extras/e0a3dc445216f6992505dfc6ba2f3103.avif?t=1787645947\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn-Based System for Careful Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles unfold on hex-based maps, with players and CPU taking turns. Lead your fleet across the seas, seize the skies with aircraft, advance over land with tanks—your careful planning shapes the course of the war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941780/extras/b6ed36f164de207986f9c697ad4e4074.avif?t=1787645947\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>50 Brand-New Maps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers 50 entirely new maps. From small islands suited for light play to large-scale battlefields for total war, both newcomers and experienced players can take their time and enjoy strategic gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941780/extras/5a670b0f5128d984323769776526045d.avif?t=1787645947\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941780/extras/2cb5c74ae6608bd18aaee5705b40b621.avif?t=1787645947\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Wield over 300 modern weapons, from jets to tanks, and outmaneuver rival forces with your strategy. From small islands to massive total-war maps, turn-based battles let both newcomers and veterans play at their own pace.", "supported_languages": "Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941780/26b6eec42075e99a1b01bd7a3385e45171183f86/header.jpg?t=1787645947", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941780/3b5c137c63331b2e2ce6076a9d47e7ea325c101c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787645947", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941780/3b5c137c63331b2e2ce6076a9d47e7ea325c101c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787645947", "website": "https://ss-beta.co.jp/products/daisenryaku-ssb-2/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows®11<br